1
00:16:54,847 --> 00:16:58,951
All my plans, the goggles,

2
00:17:00,419 --> 00:17:02,521
they were supposed
to save lives.

3
00:17:06,058 --> 00:17:08,160
What was the final
casualty count?

4
00:17:09,595 --> 00:17:14,066
- 15 civilians, 48 foundation
members, 63 deaths in total.

5
00:17:16,735 --> 00:17:20,773
- So, that's what
all this is about?

6
00:17:22,474 --> 00:17:26,745
So much death and you want
someone to pin it on, eh?

7
00:17:28,113 --> 00:17:29,581
Someone to punish.

8
00:17:37,589 --> 00:17:40,793
- Doctor, in here you will
find the clearances necessary

9
00:17:40,793 --> 00:17:45,197
to begin termination
trials on SCP 096.

10
00:17:45,197 --> 00:17:47,499
The 05 Council has
come to your side.

11
00:17:49,435 --> 00:17:51,637
- Do you mean,

12
00:17:51,637 --> 00:17:53,572
I'm allowed to kill it?

13
00:17:55,374 --> 00:17:56,575
- You're allowed to try.

14
00:17:58,243 --> 00:18:00,546
All we ask is that in
your termination attempts,

15
00:18:00,546 --> 00:18:02,214
you solidify the research

16
00:18:02,214 --> 00:18:05,818
and create a more
effective solution

17
00:18:05,818 --> 00:18:07,252
to our containment needs.

18
00:18:10,055 --> 00:18:11,690
Dr. Daniels is there
anything else you'd like

19
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:12,691
to say on record?

20
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:20,099
- No, no I think
that's everything.

21
00:18:20,099 --> 00:18:21,200
- Very well then,

22
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,102
this concludes session five

23
00:18:23,102 --> 00:18:27,272
of the SCP 096 dash one
dash alpha investigation.

24
00:18:29,608 --> 00:18:33,078
Doctor again, my condolences
to you for the loss

25
00:18:33,078 --> 00:18:34,680
of your colleagues.

26
00:18:47,259 --> 00:18:49,027
- Oleksei, we did it.

27
00:19:09,348 --> 00:19:11,116
- Good work.
- He's smart,

28
00:19:11,116 --> 00:19:13,418
I'll give him that.
- Yeah.

29
00:19:13,418 --> 00:19:16,622
- Are the 05's still online?
- We're still here

30
00:19:16,622 --> 00:19:18,023
and Inspector Everette is right,

31
00:19:18,023 --> 00:19:19,224
well done Arlia.

32
00:19:19,224 --> 00:19:20,759
- Thank you madam.
